<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89267" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεπι-τείνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stretch still further</i>: metaph., <i>contend more
				earnestly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.24.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>intensify still more</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν παροῦσαν ἐπιθυμίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.290S.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δίψος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.689e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν καλὴν νεανιείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.306
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ὀργήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					7.3.3
				</span></i>
			:—intr., of fevers, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.859
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, of wind, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.99
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>impose severer terms upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς Καρχηδονίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.63.2
				</span></i>
			: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ταῖς βασάνοις</span>
			<i>use severer</i> tortures, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				10.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> intr.,
				<i>to be prolonged</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				74
			</span></i>.</div>
